Echo Turning the colour display on...ColorDisplay onEcho Fetching Gargoyle, Install and HashTable...Bringover -p [Cedar]<CedarChest6.1>Top>Gargoyle.dfBringover -p [Cedar]<CedarChest6.1>Top>Install.DFBringover -p [Cedar]<CedarChest6.1>Top>HashTable.dfEcho Loading HashTable, then the Install command Gargoyle.load needs...Run HashTableImplRun InstallImplEcho Loading Gargoyle, its packages, and the ColorTool...Source Gargoyle.loadEcho Now type  Gargoyle  to open it.